comment.narrative:
To date, US$50.5 million has been disbursed to IOM, which has expensed US$22 million and committed US$22.3 million, or 68% of the total component allocation of US$65 million. The component reached nearly 300,000 (81% of 371,000 targets of drought induced IDPs i Mogadishu, Baidoa, and Garowe as well as host communities. This will be fully reported in the next ISR after full completion of the activities.&nbsp;

			8,400 IDPs have been provided with safe and clean water through completed boreholes in Mogaidshu. Gender disaggregation will be provided in next round of reporting.

			&nbsp;
